### Example Vite environment variables
# Copy this file to `.env.local` or `.env` and update values for your environment.
# Important: Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to your client code.

# API base URL used by the frontend when calling the backend API.
# For local dev you can set it to your machine IP (e.g. http://172.16.18.118:3000) or a proxy path like /api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
